{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":43.29999923706055,"text":"Fifty kilometers south of the town, a rock 116 meters high rises above white houses and two bays. On its summit stood the Temple of Athena Lindia, and around it a colonnade of 42 columns, built so that it could be seen from the sea. The knights later wrapped the whole rock in a castle, so you climb up through medieval walls to reach an ancient temple. At the foot of the great staircase is the best piece of all, a warship carved directly into the rock, the bow at life's size, with the steps themselves running up against it. A statue once stood on it. It is 2,000-year-old advertising, Lindos lived by ships, and it's said so in stone.","words":[{"word":"Fifty","start":0,"end":0.7599999904632568},{"word":"kilometers","start":0.7599999904632568,"end":1.2599999904632568},{"word":"south","start":1.2599999904632568,"end":1.6399999856948853},{"word":"of","start":1.6399999856948853,"end":1.8600000143051147},{"word":"the","start":1.8600000143051147,"end":1.940000057220459},{"word":"town","start":1.940000057220459,"end":2.200000047683716},{"word":"a","start":2.700000047683716,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"rock","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.0799999237060547},{"word":"116","start":3.0799999237060547,"end":4.460000038146973},{"word":"meters","start":4.460000038146973,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"high","start":4.760000228881836,"end":5.28000020980835},{"word":"rises","start":5.28000020980835,"end":5.800000190734863},{"word":"above","start":5.800000190734863,"end":6.199999809265137},{"word":"white","start":6.199999809265137,"end":6.599999904632568},{"word":"houses","start":6.599999904632568,"end":6.880000114440918},{"word":"and","start":6.880000114440918,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"two","start":7.260000228881836,"end":7.900000095367432},{"word":"bays","start":7.900000095367432,"end":7.900000095367432},{"word":"On","start":8.640000343322754,"end":8.779999732971191},{"word":"its","start"